<title>UK: Lloyds shares squeezed to fresh record.</title>
<headline>Lloyds shares squeezed to fresh record.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lloyds TSB Group Plc shares were squeezed to a record high for a fourth straight session on Tuesday as investment funds continued to pour into the banking sector, dealers said.</p>
</text>
